  "<div class=\"recuerda\">\n    <div class=\"recuerda-titulo\">💡 Recuerda</div>\n    <div class=\"recuerda-idea\">Para contar muchas cosas sin perdernos hacemos un <strong>recuento con palotes</strong>: cada cosa que contamos es un palote. El <strong>quinto palote cruza</strong> a los otros cuatro, así los palotes quedan en grupos de 5.</div>\n    <div class=\"recuerda-ejemplo\">\n      <div class=\"rec-item\">\n        <div class=\"recuento\">\n          <svg class=\"palote1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 30\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"26\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"rec-num\">= 1</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rec-item\">\n        <div class=\"recuento\">\n          <svg class=\"palote1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 30\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"26\"/></svg>\n          <svg class=\"palote1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 30\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"26\"/></svg>\n          <svg class=\"palote1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 30\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"26\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"rec-num\">= 3</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rec-item\">\n        <div class=\"recuento\">\n          <svg class=\"palote5\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 30\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"13\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"13\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"29\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"29\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"23\" x2=\"33\" y2=\"7\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"rec-num\">= 5</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rec-item\">\n        <div class=\"recuento\">\n          <svg class=\"palote5\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 30\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"13\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"13\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"29\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"29\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"23\" x2=\"33\" y2=\"7\"/></svg>\n          <svg class=\"palote1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 30\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"26\"/></svg>\n          <svg