  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">3.</span> Mira la tabla del ejercicio 2 y <strong>responde</strong>:</div>\n    <div class=\"preg-lista\">\n      <div class=\"preg-fila\">a) ¿De qué transporte hay <strong>MÁS</strong>? <span class=\"preg-hueco-grande\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"preg-fila\">b) ¿De cuál hay <strong>MENOS</strong>? <span class=\"preg-hueco-grande\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"preg-fila\">c) ¿Cuántos coches y bicis hay <strong>en total</strong>? Operación: <span class=\"preg-hueco-op\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"preg-fila\">d) ¿Cuántos coches <strong>más que</strong> barcos hay? Operación: <span class=\"preg-hueco-op\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">4.</span> <strong>Rodea</strong> V (verdadero) o F (falso):</div>\n    <div class=\"vf-lista\">\n      <div class=\"vf-fila\">\n        <span>1. Hay más bicis que barcos.</span>\n        <span class=\"vf-pills\"><span class=\"vf-pill\">V</span><span class=\"vf-pill\">F</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"vf-fila\">\n        <span>2. Hay 4 aviones.</span>\n        <span class=\"vf-pills\"><span class=\"vf-pill\">V</span><span class=\"vf-pill\">F</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"vf-fila\">\n        <span>3. El barco es el transporte del que hay menos.</span>\n        <span class=\"vf-pills\"><span class=\"vf-pill\">V</span><span class=\"vf-pill\">F</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"vf-fila\">\n        <span>4. Un grupo de palotes cruzado\n          <span class=\"recuento-inline\"><svg class=\"palote5\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 30\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"13\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"13\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"29\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"29\" y2=\"26\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"23\" x2=\"33\" y2=\"7\"/></svg></span>\n          y 3 palotes sueltos\n          <span class=\"recuento-inline\"><svg class=\"palote1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 30\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"26\"/></svg><svg class=\"palote1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 30\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"26\"/></svg><svg class=\"palote1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 30\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"26\"/></svg></span>\n          valen 8.</span>\n        <span class=\"vf-pills\"><span class=\"vf-pill\">V</span><span class=\"vf-pill\">F</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
